<title>USA: Telegraph settles litigation with Globes.</title>
<headline>Telegraph settles litigation with Globes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telegraph Communications Ltd said on Tuesday it and Globes Publish Newspaper Ltd agreed to settle litigation, and Globes agreed to withdraw a claim it filed against Telegraph in the regional labor court of Tel Aviv-Jafa on January 14, 1993.  </p>
<p>Telegraph Communications was not immediately available to comment further on the matter.</p>
</text>
